srFtlru~n7leKGuC3RR6WfxKDgegOplPYO7O4YKsH4gyawCnMyIhE8ceBAo1FqoLUyCKvxWqbbtl1BSXoA__&amp;Key-Pair-Id=APKAJ535ZH3ZAIIOADHQ" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" loading="eager"><div class="c x0 y1 w2 h2"><div class="t m0 x1 h3 y2 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">Sure! Let me carefully review the provided content and correct any mistakes<span class="_ _0"></span> or inconsistencies. I</div><div class="t m0 x1 h3 y3 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">will ensure accuracy in the one-line statements while preserving the original context. Here's the </div><div class="t m0 x1 h3 y4 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">corrected version:</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y5 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">1.<span class="_ _1"> </span>Ribosomes after protein formation arrive at <span class="ff2">Golgi b<span class="_ _0"></span>odies</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y6 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">2.<span class="_ _1"> </span>The nuclear membrane is continuous with the <span class="ff2">Endoplasmic reticulum<span class="_ _0"></span></span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y7 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">3.<span class="_ _1"> </span>The power generation organelle of the cell is <span class="ff2 ws0">Mitochondria<span class="_ _0"></span></span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y8 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">4.<span class="_ _1"> </span>The observable feature in the subject of genetics is <span class="_ _0"></span><span class="ff2">All of these</span> (Trait, Character &amp; </div><div class="t m0 x3 h3 y9 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Phenotype).</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 ya ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">5.<span class="_ _1"> </span>Bacteriophage is a <span class="ff2 ws0">Virus</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 yb ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">6.<span class="_ _1"> </span>Hershey and Chase proposed that DNA is the hereditary material in <span class="_ _0"></span><span class="ff2 ws0">1952</span>, not <span class="ff2 ws0">1944</span> </div><div class="t m0 x3 h3 yc ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">(which corresponds to Avery's work).</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 yd ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">7.<span class="_ _1"> </span>The most significant feature of Down syndrome is <span class="ff2">short stature<span class="_ _0"></span></span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 ye ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">8.<span class="_ _1"> </span>The disease with no excision repair system causing severe sunburn and dry skin is </div><div class="t m0 x3 h3 yf ff2 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">Xeroderma pigmentosum<span class="ff1">.</span></div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y10 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">9.<span class="_ _1"> </span>Characters of Turner syndrome include <span class="ff2">All mentioned<span class="_ _0"></span></span> (short stature, lymphedema, broad</div><div class="t m0 x3 h3 y11 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">chest).</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y12 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">10.<span class="_"> </span>Xeroderma pigmentation may be caused by <span class="ff2">UV light</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y13 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">11.<span class="_"> </span>A single palmar fold is known as <span class="ff2">Simian crease</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y14 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">12.<span class="_"> </span>The large subunits of ribosomes contain <span class="ff2">45 polypeptides</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y15 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">13.<span class="_"> </span>The bond formed by sharing electrons is a <span class="ff2">Covalent bond<span class="_ _0"></span></span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y16 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">14.<span class="_"> </span><span class="ff2">Kinetic energy</span> is the energy of motion.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y17 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">15.<span class="_"> </span>Ribosomes can be free or attached to the <span class="ff2">Endoplasmic reticulum<span class="_ _0"></span></span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y18 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">16.<span class="_"> </span>The organ/molecule that can convert light energy is <span class="_ _0"></span><span class="ff2 ws0">Chlorophyll</span>, not <span class="ff2 ws0">NAD</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y19 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">17.<span class="_"> </span>Beta pleated sheets are found in the <span class="ff2">Secondary protein structure<span class="_ _0"></span></span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y1a ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">18.<span class="_"> </span>Inhibitors binding to a site other than the active site are <span class="_ _0"></span><span class="ff2">Non-competitive inhibitors</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y1b ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">19.<span class="_"> </span>Lipids act as a component of the cell membrane in a <span class="_ _0"></span><span class="ff2">Fluid mosaic model</span>, not "Lake."</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y1c ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">20.<span class="_"> </span>Cells have <span class="ff2">4 macromolecules</span> (proteins, nucleic acids, carbohydrates,<span class="_ _0"></span> and lipids).</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y1d ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">21.<span class="_"> </span>Cell membranes expel particles by vesicle formation in <span class="_ _0"></span><span class="ff2 ws0">Exocytosis</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y1e ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">22.<span class="_"> </span>Molecules of phospholipids have <span class="ff2">Hydrophobic &amp; Hydrophilic domains<span class="_ _0"></span></span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y1f ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">23.<span class="_"> </span>If one gene prevents the expression of another, it is called <span class="ff2 ws0">Epistasis<span class="_ _0"></span></span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y20 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">24.<span class="_"> </span>Phenylalanine hydroxylase metabolizes <span class="ff2">Phenylalanine<span class="_ _0"></span> to Tyrosine</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y21 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">25.<span class="_"> </span>Restriction enzymes inhibit the growth of <span class="ff2">Viruses in bacteria (bacteriophages)<span class="_ _0"></span></span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y22 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">26.<span class="_"> </span>The absence of homogentisic acid oxidase causes <span class="ff2 ws0">Alkaptonuria<span class="_ _0"></span></span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y23 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">27.<span class="_"> </span>Microtubules originate from the <span class="ff2 ws0">Centrosome<span class="_ _0"></span></span>, not "Cytoskeletal."</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y24 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">28.<span class="_"> </span>The disintegration and condensation of nuclear material occur in<span class="_ _0"></span> <span class="ff2">Prophase I</span>, not </div><div class="t m0 x3 h3 y25 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">"Prophase II."</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y26 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">29.<span class="_"> </span>RNAs in large subunits of eukaryotic ribosomes are <span class="ff2 ws0">3</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y27 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">30.<span class="_"> </span>Centromeres separate during the anaphase of <span class="ff2 ws0">Mitosis</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y28 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">31.<span class="_"> </span>Enormous genetic information is present in <span class="ff2 ws0">DNA</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y29 ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">32.<span class="_"> </span>Okazaki fragments are joined by <span class="ff2 ws0">Ligase</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y2a ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">33.<span class="_"> </span>Water content in a cell is <span class="ff2 ws0">70%</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y2b ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">34.<span class="_"> </span>The charge on DNA is <span class="ff2 ws0">Negative</span>, not "Neutral" (due to phosphate groups).</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y2c ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">35.<span class="_"> </span>The structure stabilizing cell shape is <span class="ff2 ws0">A<span class="_ _0"></span>ctin</span>.</div><div class="t m0 x2 h3 y2d ff1 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws1">36.<span class="_"> </span>The space between the double membrane structure of the endoplasmic reticulum<span class="_ _0"></span> is the </div><div class="t m0 x3 h3 y2e ff2 fs0 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Lumen<span class="ff1">.</span></div></div></div><div class="pi" data-data="{&quot;ctm&quot;:[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}"></div></div></div><div class="InlineBanner_inline-banner-wrapper__DAi5X banner-wrapper hidden-on-mobile hidden-on-tablet" style="height: 0px;"><div class="InlineBanner_inline-banner-placeholder__SJbvQ" style="transform: scale(1.69061) translateX(-50%); width: 384px;"><div class="PromoAppInterstitial_promo-app-interstitial__3WA1H hidden-on-mobile hidden-on-tablet"><div class="PromoAppInterstitial_illustration__E9xTS"><svg fill="none" height="141" viewBox="0 0 146 141" width="146" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_15951_2675)"><rect fill="#F6F7FB" height="143.195" rx="10.6601" width="145" x="0.0725098" y="22.6487"></rect><g clip-path="url(#clip1_15951_2675)"><path d="M19.6212 31.4553L20.2393 32.7842L21.5682 33.4023C21.6506 33.4435 21.7124 33.5259 21.7124 33.6186C21.7124 33.7216 21.6506 33.804 21.5682 33.8452L20.2393 34.4633L19.6212 35.7922C19.58 35.8746 19.4976 35.9261 19.4048 35.9261C19.3018 35.9261 19.2194 35.8746 19.1782 35.7922L18.5601 34.4633L17.2312 33.8452C17.1488 33.804 17.0973 33.7216 17.0973 33.6186C17.0973 33.5259 17.1488 33.4435 17.2312 33.4023L18.5601 32.7842L19.1782 31.4553C19.2194 31.3728 19.3018 31.311 19.4048 31.311C19.4976 31.311 19.58 31.3728 19.6212 31.4553Z" fill="#F064FC"></path><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16.9417 32.8022L17.0512 32.7512H12.6036C11.8619 32.7512 11.285 33.3487 11.285 34.0698V41.9814C11.285 42.7231 11.8619 43.3 12.6036 43.3H17.878C18.5992 43.3 19.1966 42.7231 19.1966 41.9814V36.5694C18.9374 36.5111 18.7093 36.3442 18.5823 36.0902L18.5781 36.0818L18.0586 34.9649L16.9417 34.4454L16.9333 34.4412C16.613 34.281 16.4311 33.9601 16.4311 33.6186C16.4311 33.2715 16.627 32.9595 16.9333 32.8064L16.9417 32.8022ZM12.6036 35.7181C12.6036 35.9035 12.7479 36.0477 12.9333 36.0477H17.5484C17.7132 36.0477 17.878 35.9035 17.878 35.7181C17.878 35.5533 17.7132 35.