<p class="ContentTextElements_p___vCmT">ï‚· Detects pathogens, mutations, and forensic DNA analysis.
ï‚· Amplifies DNA for sequencing or genetic studies.</p>
<h2>21. DNA Replication Methods:</h2>
<p class="ContentTextElements_p___vCmT">ï‚· Semi-conservative: Each new DNA has one old and one new strand.
ï‚· Conservative: Original DNA is preserved.
ï‚· Dispersive: DNA is mixed in new strands.</p>
<h2>22. Plasmids:</h2>
<p class="ContentTextElements_p___vCmT">ï‚· Circular DNA used for gene transfer (e., antibiotic resistance).
ï‚· Essential in genetic engineering and bacterial conjugation.</p>
<h2>23. Lipid Bilayer Function:</h2>
<p class="ContentTextElements_p___vCmT">ï‚· Structural component of membranes.
ï‚· Regulates diffusion and separates cell contents from the environment.</p></div></div></section></section></div><section><div class="Footer_footer-wrapper__ljdae"><footer class="Footer_footer__TQcNR"><div class="Footer_container__dhzOI"><div class="Footer_large-screen-row___IzU8"><div class="Footer_columns-container__n0Xb7"><div class="Footer_logo-column__JX2Og Hidden_average-phone__tZFbg Hidden_small-phone__1TLCl"><svg aria-label="Studocu Logo" class="Logo_logo__YEe0c" height="30px" role="img" viewBox="0 0 124 30" width="124px" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path class="LogoVariants_gray__3VKqg" d="M43.611 13.803c-.8017-.2642-1.6225-.4655-2.4552-.6023-.5518-.1011-.9672-.1851-1.24-.2505-.2457-.0534-.4788-.1537-.6866-.2957-.0855-.058-.1552-.1364-.2029-.2283-.0476-.0918-.0716-.1941-.07-.2977-.0014-.1127.0285-.2237.0862-.3204.0578-.0967.1412-.1754.2409-.2273.2605-.1424.5547-.2107.8509-.1977.3973-.0071.7867.1116 1.1129.3393.2976.1992.5261.4863.6541.8216h3.9494c-.0944-.7994-.4211-1.5533-.9393-2.1677-.5448-.64425-1.2358-1.1476-2.015-1.4675-1.6979-.70142-3.603-.70142-5.301 0-.7347.3086-1.3691.8168-1.8321 1.4675-.4391.6358-.6679 1.3941-.6541 2.1677 0 .9929.2253 1.7595.6758 2.3001.4169.5163.9678.9067 1.5919 1.1282.762.2485 1.5426.4354 2.3343.5587.5673.1037 1.0075.1914 1.3206.263.2807.0585.5452.178.775.3501.1001.0767.1805.1763.2344.2905.054.1143.0799.2398.0756.3662 0 .1224-.0322.2426-.0935.3484-.0612.1057-.1493.1933-.2553.2538-.2913.1687-.6252.2487-.961.2303-.3383.0021-.6744-.0569-.992-.1742-.2922-.1034-.5572-.2721-.775-.4933-.1938-.1935-.3232-.4425-.3704-.7128h-3.8843c.0757.8457.3993 1.6499.93 2.3109.5567.6846 1.2771 1.2162 2.094 1.5453.903.3723 1.8713.5586 2.8474.5478.9417.0141 1.876-.1687 2.7435-.5369.7653-.3186 1.4294-.8411 1.9204-1.511.4619-.6399.7064-1.4119.6975-2.202 0-1.0375-.2397-1.8405-.7192-2.409-.4445-.5443-1.0279-.9574-1.6879-1.1951zm9.399 3.842c-.0795-.0804-.1418-.1763-.1831-.2817-.0414-.1054-.0608-.2182-.0572-.3315v-4.8817h2.635V8.6456h-2.635V4.7458l-4.